The model weights are not part of this repository either. The recipe serves
LibertAIDAI/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-EXL3-2.9bpw and the Engram tables of deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017,
both under the MIT License; their license files come with the downloads.

The drafter overlay the recipe serves (drafter D1, https://huggingface.co/ursuciprian/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-DSpark-D1)
is not part of this repository. It replaces the DSpark drafter tensors (mtp.*) of
LibertAIDAI/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-EXL3-2.9bpw with my refit of them, and is published under that checkpoint's
MIT License. The prompts used to fit it came from ten public datasets, credited with their licenses on its model card;
no dataset text is part of the overlay or this repository.
